    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      470.58,
      295.21,
      545.34
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land depicted as Lot \u2018A\u2019 in extent of about0.0535 Hectare, depicted in Advance Tracing No. KA/BRW/07/758and dated 07.12.2007, prepared by the Surveyor-General of KalutaraDistrict, situated in the Village of Duwegoda in the Minor Divisionof Kalutara Thotamuna-South in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionof Beruwala in Kalutara District, Western Province and boundedas follows:",
